{"name":"Rauthil","status":"ok","title":"Rauthil","pageId":142871,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Rauthil</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup id=\"cite_ref-OE.M_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE.M-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-IA_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-IA-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRA-p11_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRA-p11-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Town</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mulhorand\" title=\"Mulhorand\">Mulhorand</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Old_Empires\" title=\"Old Empires\">Old Empires</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Politics<sup id=\"cite_ref-OE.p15,21_4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE.p15,21-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Precept <a href=\"/wiki/Ethnestus\" title=\"Ethnestus\">Ethnestus</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/1357_DR\" title=\"1357 DR\">1357 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Rauthil\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Rauthil\">Inhabitants of  Rauthil</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Rauthil\" title=\"Category:Locations in Rauthil\">Locations in  Rauthil</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"DPL-purge plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Category_intersection_jump?DPL_cat1=Locations_in__Rauthil&DPL_cat2=Roads&action=purge\">Roads  in  Rauthil</a></span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"DPL-purge plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Category_intersection_jump?DPL_cat1=Locations_in__Rauthil&DPL_cat2=Bodies_of_water&action=purge\">Bodies of water  in  Rauthil</a></span></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Rauthil</b> was a town located in the country of <a href=\"/wiki/Mulhorand\" title=\"Mulhorand\">Mulhorand</a> during the mid–14<sup>th</sup> century <a href=\"/wiki/DR\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-OE.p15,21_4-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE.p15,21-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-OE.M_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE.M-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-IA_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-IA-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRA-p11_3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRA-p11-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> \n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Activities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Activities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Rauthil?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rauthil was located along the southern bank of the <a href=\"/wiki/River_Rauthenflow\" title=\"River Rauthenflow\">River Rauthenflow</a> due north of <a href=\"/wiki/Maerlar\" title=\"Maerlar\">Maerlar</a> on the <a href=\"/wiki/Great_South_Road\" title=\"Great South Road\">Great South Road</a> in north Mulhorand.<sup id=\"cite_ref-OE.M_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE.M-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-IA_2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-IA-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRA-p11_3-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRA-p11-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Rauthil?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The precept of Rauthil in the <a href=\"/wiki/1357_DR\" title=\"1357 DR\">Year of the Prince, 1357 DR</a>, was a <a href=\"/wiki/Priest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Priest\">priest</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Horus-Re\" title=\"Horus-Re\">Horus-Re</a> named <a href=\"/wiki/Ethnestus\" title=\"Ethnestus\">Ethnestus</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-OE.p15,21_4-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE.p15,21-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Activities\">Activities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Activities\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Rauthil?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Activities\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rauthil was an important location in that it was the only place along the River Rauthenflow where a bridge was constructed allowing for easy crossing.<sup id=\"cite_ref-OE.p15,21_4-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE.p15,21-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Rauthil?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Rauthil?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-OE.M-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE.M_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE.M_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE.M_1-2\">1.2</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Map included in&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Scott_Bennie\" title=\"Scott Bennie\">Scott Bennie</a>&#160;(February 1990). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Old_Empires_(sourcebook)\" title=\"Old Empires (sourcebook)\">Old Empires</a></i>. Edited by <a href=\"/wiki/Mike_Breault\" title=\"Mike Breault\">Mike Breault</a>. (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc.\" title=\"TSR, Inc.\">TSR, Inc.</a>). ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0880388214.\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-0880388214.\">978-0880388214.</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-IA-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-IA_2-0\">2.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-IA_2-1\">2.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-IA_2-2\">2.2</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/ProFantasy_Software_Ltd.\" title=\"ProFantasy Software Ltd.\">ProFantasy Software Ltd.</a> (1999). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Forgotten_Realms_Interactive_Atlas\" title=\"Forgotten Realms Interactive Atlas\">Forgotten Realms Interactive Atlas</a></i>. <a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc.\" title=\"TSR, Inc.\">TSR, Inc.</a> File: B1dlc.FCW</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-FRA-p11-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRA-p11_3-0\">3.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRA-p11_3-1\">3.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRA-p11_3-2\">3.2</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karen_Wynn_Fonstad\" title=\"Karen Wynn Fonstad\">Karen Wynn Fonstad</a>&#160;(August 1990). <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Forgotten_Realms_Atlas\" title=\"The Forgotten Realms Atlas\">The Forgotten Realms Atlas</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"TSR, Inc\">TSR, Inc</a>), p. 11. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0880388573\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-0880388573\">978-0880388573</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-OE.p15,21-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE.p15,21_4-0\">4.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE.p15,21_4-1\">4.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE.p15,21_4-2\">4.2</a></sup> <s